{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9846a5b0039684ba5924cd6455a456348cc121d90877ac34d97995984688ceee", "ja": "雑誌の撮影　休憩中", "zh": "杂志拍摄　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6000_place", "source_sha256": "5906373941ba7a4d2d139c6e9e8d8c9b8a290607b1613865032ae97b0494462c", "ja": "神社", "zh": "神社", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6001_p", "source_sha256": "a1b18955da8847fbca80c3381264c60e5f4eae1ffe9b6ccfe96b0b1c17b8f24e", "ja": "（静香のグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は\n順調だ。もうすぐ休憩に入る予定だったが……）", "zh": "（静香拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的工作进展顺利。本来马上就要休息了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6002_015siz", "source_sha256": "2da048027698821f8182d3ae543563944d120913078b52bb95e25073e0d756cd", "ja": "休憩中にオフショットを撮るんですか？\n突然ですね……でも分かりました。任せてください！", "zh": "休息时间要拍花絮照吗？\n真突然……不过我明白了。交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6003_p", "source_sha256": "cd65b5d2591f9e76dd76ed32c07b156a7ffa152bde65c73306aff33c645b29f9", "ja": "ありがとう。せっかくの休憩なのに、\nゆっくり休めなくて悪いな。", "zh": "谢谢。难得的休息时间，\n却没法让你好好休息，不好意思啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6004_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ace0261f1ce357b1f3486bdff5235c68498a3c310a20ca74dde7a4cafff9687", "ja": "平気ですよ。この衣装の良さを引き出して、\nしっかり撮ってもらう。それが私の仕事ですから。", "zh": "没关系的。展现出这身服装的魅力，\n好好配合拍摄。这就是我的工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6005_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c5902c7f1ab0b463cd6c7665b454fff33077bc952c033e4a7c8b67d336b1faf", "ja": "でもどういう風に過ごしたら魅力的に見えるんだろう。\nオフショットとはいえ撮影ですから。迷いますね……。", "zh": "不过，要怎样度过才会显得有魅力呢？虽说是花絮照，但毕竟是在拍摄。真让人苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6006_p", "source_sha256": "d220da32fc690dfd86060c18bd72e78dc08726283ac95e1bda8db5c4f73e15fb", "ja": "そうだな……。でもオフショットだからこそ、\n普段通りの姿を見せた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……不过正因为是花絮照，不是更应该展现平时的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6007_015siz", "source_sha256": "10bbe8cf5cb97eb3a0cf442baf9c67bd489ce0593ddbb5d75de0368598b49e0f", "ja": "確かに……。意識しすぎるのも、よくありませんね。\nそれじゃ、いつも通りの感じで過ごします。", "zh": "说得也是……。太刻意的话，也不太好。\n那就像平时一样自然地过吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6008_015siz", "source_sha256": "67b3d636b4f5f32896519de2e057ef56caa130624c8eb96db36b7747b0a03e24", "ja": "あっ、お昼は、狐にちなんだものを食べようと\n思ってたんです。うーん、何がいいかな……？", "zh": "啊，中午我本来想吃点和狐狸有关的东西。嗯——吃什么好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6009", "source_sha256": "973e11b80f8e44d8aa785ccb60856e2404295bb521658a925bab6951a998cdf2", "ja": "きつねうどん", "zh": "狐狸乌冬面", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6010", "source_sha256": "96f24fe9720ca7a85e82334199526cfe3ffb43d2d550fce46347efcd137cfb32", "ja": "おいなりさん", "zh": "稻荷寿司", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6011", "source_sha256": "3b9adfb78881345471783b7a4ba252626a5becb8d575c04b8edcf3096e9e6284", "ja": "信田煮", "zh": "油豆腐皮煮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6100_p", "source_sha256": "855c9d98c9855e53808006fd4deb5a97d6e167e14dfa7e3b51d8e562457b3f5f", "ja": "きつねうどんはどうだ？\n狐といったら、やっぱり油揚げじゃないか？", "zh": "狐狸乌冬怎么样？\n说到狐狸，果然还是油豆腐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6101_015siz", "source_sha256": "13f9e217ab0f965f9c3f64c8f11be40ef415d9b5e1e14fc0ca2bbc039cc9fe35", "ja": "わあ～、とってもいいですね！　狐ならではですし、\n甘いおあげは疲労回復にもいいんですよ！", "zh": "哇～，太棒了！既很有狐狸的特色，\n而且甜甜的油豆腐对恢复疲劳也很有好处呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6102_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b48d00d4c677cef3385400e78f2eefa661d8ad41b85e37eb8a6e6ec534cd021", "ja": "思い出してたら、お腹が空いてきました……。\n早く食べに行きましょう、ふふっ♪", "zh": "回想起来，肚子都饿了……\n赶紧去吃吧，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6200_p", "source_sha256": "18b06b94c77a9408140b5acbc10dd6daf594774b2364abcdcad9f9fe044bce32", "ja": "おいなりさんとかいいんじゃないか？\n安易かもしれないが、狐といえば……な料理だろ？", "zh": "吃稻荷寿司怎么样？\n虽然可能有点直接，但说到狐狸……不就是这道料理吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6201_015siz", "source_sha256": "9141290b18fea0b7aaa2e5df8201cd2d5c2671388c0b1a81dc2c36d022d03523", "ja": "なるほど。今日の場所的にもピッタリですね！\nなんだか縁起もよさそう。……あっ、でも。", "zh": "原来如此。从今天的场地来看也非常合适呢！\n感觉也很吉利。……啊，不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6202_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e382dbd8064b03e23e0ee61a7d76dcc29810f3ce380973f931a567f7060670c", "ja": "できれば、小さいサイズでお願いします。大きな口を\n開けてる姿を撮られたら、恥ずかしいですから……。", "zh": "可以的话，请选小份的。要是被拍到张大嘴巴的样子，会很难为情的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6300_p", "source_sha256": "882a818c712ff29bbc6dee6a2a0301ee8b2f74e47ae593e527c8703be8dfa9bb", "ja": "信田煮なんて、どうだ？　狐に関係のある料理らしい。\nこの前、テレビでやってたよ。", "zh": "信田煮怎么样？听说是和狐狸有关的料理。前阵子电视上介绍过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6301_015siz", "source_sha256": "97be69f5d0a8d480d4c9a8d875798d03221f1a73e7cbafb599d9069de62eb11f", "ja": "シノダニィ……なんだかオシャレな響きですね？\n初めて聞きますけど、どこの国のお料理なんですか？", "zh": "信田煮……听起来莫名有种时髦的感觉呢？我还是第一次听说，这是哪个国家的料理呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6302_p", "source_sha256": "427964af1b6cb4903aaec670137672274540552cf57c3bbdc2e17e4616952c94", "ja": "いや、その……。信田煮は、油揚げに様々な具材を\n入れて煮込んだ日本の料理だ！　すまんっ！", "zh": "不，那个……信田煮是把各种食材放进油豆腐里炖煮的日本料理！抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_6303_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca2e869ca2bbf85e5dee5e064fa28571f38d8b80604a05758e8b8235026e4142", "ja": "か、勘違いしてるって気づいてたら、教えてください！\n……もう～。ちょっとひとりにしてください！", "zh": "如、如果发现我理解错了，请告诉我！\n……真是的～请让我一个人待会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
